---
---
<section class="section-deliverables" id="deliverables">
  <div class="container relative z-10">
    <div class="del-header">
      <h2 class="del-title">Noua prezenta.<br>Ce construim impreuna.</h2>
      <p class="del-desc">
        Pachetele noastre acopera tot ce ai nevoie pentru o prezenta profesionala pe web, fara costuri ascunse.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Pricing Cards Container -->
    <div class="pricing-cards-wrapper">
      
      <!-- Basic Package (Starter equivalent) -->
      <div class="pricing-card card-basic">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-icon-header">
            <div class="icon-box">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="plan-name">Pachet de Baza</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-wrap">
            <span class="currency">€</span><span class="price-amount">1,499</span><span class="price-period">/proiect</span>
          </div>
          <p class="plan-desc">Perfect pentru companii mici la inceput de drum.</p>
        </div>
        
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Structura si continut:</strong> Clarificam grupurile tinta, structuram mesajele.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Design web individual:</strong> Cream un design potrivit companiei.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Implementare tehnica:</strong> Pentru smartphone, tableta si desktop.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Publicare si predare:</strong> Pregatim publicarea, accesurile si drepturile.</div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="card-action">
          <a href="/projekt-anfragen/" class="btn-plan btn-outline">Stabileste o discutie &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Complete Package (Pro equivalent) -->
      <div class="pricing-card card-complete">
        <div class="popular-badge">Cel mai popular</div>
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="card-icon-header">
            <div class="icon-box">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <path d="M12 8l4 4-4 4M8 12h8"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="plan-name">Pachet Complet</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-wrap">
            <span class="currency">€</span><span class="price-amount">2,499</span><span class="price-period">/proiect</span>
          </div>
          <p class="plan-desc">Ideal pentru companii in crestere cu nevoi complexe.</p>
        </div>
        
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Tot din Pachetul de Baza</strong> plus optimizari avansate.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Optimizare SEO:</strong> Structura si continut optimizat pentru Google.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Functionalitati extra:</strong> Formulare complexe sau functionalitati custom.</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="check-icon"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <div><strong>Suport prioritar:</strong> Asistenta directa dupa lansare.</div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="card-action">
          <a href="/projekt-anfragen/" class="btn-plan btn-solid">Incepe proiectul &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="bottom-disclaimer text-center mt-12">
      <strong>Extensii optionale:</strong> marketingul, materialele tiparite sau imbracamintea pentru companie sunt incluse numai cand sustin obiectivul si sunt convenite expres.
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-deliverables {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #fafafa;
    font-family: var(--font-body, system-ui, sans-serif);
  }
  
  .del-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
  }
  
  .del-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  
  .del-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pricing-cards-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    padding: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }

  /* Right Card (Elevated/Solid style matching reference) */
  .card-complete {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
  }

  .popular-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15px;
    left: 3rem;
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .card-top {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .card-icon-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }
  
  .icon-box svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .plan-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .price-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .currency {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 0.2rem;
  }

  .price-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .price-period {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .plan-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .features-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .features-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .features-list li strong {
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    color: #10b981;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .card-action {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .btn-plan {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .btn-solid {
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-navy);
  }
  .btn-solid:hover {
    background: #0f1b30;
  }

  .bottom-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 3rem auto 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pricing-cards-wrapper {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
